@startuml C3_Components_HighLevel
skinparam shadowing false
title UGTM — Composition root và quyền sở hữu dữ liệu
component "UGTM.Api\nModuleRegistration / IModule[]" as API
package "Sáu module — Domain/Application/Contracts/Infrastructure riêng" {
 component "Identity\nIdentityDbContext / identity" as Identity
 component "AcademicPeriods\nAcademicPeriodsDbContext / academic" as AcademicPeriods
 component "TopicCatalog\nTopicCatalogDbContext / topics" as TopicCatalog
 component "ThesisManagement\nThesisManagementDbContext / thesis" as ThesisManagement
 component "DefenseCouncil\nDefenseCouncilDbContext / councils" as DefenseCouncil
 component "Notifications\nNotificationsDbContext / notifications" as Notifications
}
component "BuildingBlocks.Infrastructure\nNpgsql, conventions, ModuleDbContext\nGlobalExceptionMiddleware" as BBI
component "EF CLI / UGTM.Database.Migrations\nUGTMDbContext + Factory + Migrations\nCrossModuleForeignKeys" as Migration
database "PostgreSQL / Neon\n38 bảng nghiệp vụ / 6 schema\npublic.__ef_migrations_history" as DB
API --> Identity : DI / endpoints
API --> AcademicPeriods
API --> TopicCatalog
API --> ThesisManagement
API --> DefenseCouncil
API --> Notifications
API --> BBI
Identity --> DB : Model identity
AcademicPeriods --> DB : Model academic
TopicCatalog --> DB : Model topics
ThesisManagement --> DB : Model thesis
DefenseCouncil --> DB : Model councils
Notifications --> DB : Model notifications
Migration ..> Identity : Ghép EF configurations
Migration ..> AcademicPeriods
Migration ..> TopicCatalog
Migration ..> ThesisManagement
Migration ..> DefenseCouncil
Migration ..> Notifications
Migration --> DB : Migration toàn hệ thống
note bottom of Migration
Context tổng hợp không đăng ký DI runtime, không cho SaveChanges.
Module không tham chiếu Database.Migrations hoặc internals module khác.
Domain không có navigation liên module; FK vật lý được ghép tại đây.
end note
note bottom of API
HTTP có 6 endpoint ping và Authentication API của Identity.
Domain có aggregate nhóm và calculator; API nghiệp vụ KLTN chưa triển khai.
end note
@enduml
